  "title": "Southern China is ours",
  "briefing": "Halcyon Group holds Southern China through its customs hall. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Southern China Blackout: Halcyon Group runs Southern China from its customs hall, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, silence the warden, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Southern China wakes up with the customs hall in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Southern China before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
